Over 30 years ago, America produced nearly 40% of the world’s microchip supply.

Today, we only produce about 10%.

@POTUS signed the CHIPS and Science Act to bring semiconductor manufacturing back to America, and it’s happening. https://t.co/qbKWGLo8G9

